## d. Kesejahteraan Pegawai

Selain penghasilan bulanan berupa gaji dan tunjangan transportasi, pegawai juga memperoleh tunjangan lain seperti Tunjangan Hari Raya (THR), tunjangan cuti, dan bantuan uang duka bila pegawai atau keluarganya mengalami musibah meninggal dunia. Bentuk kesejahteraan pegawai lain di Perseroan meliputi:

- Jamsostek (jaminan kematian, jaminan kecelakaan kerja, jaminan hari tua);
- Medical check up;
- Family gathering;
- Jasa produksi;
- Cuti;
- Perawatan kesehatan;
- Penggantian kaca mata; dan

## d. Employee Welfare

Other than monthly income, that is salary and transportation allowance, the employees receive other allowances such as holiday allowance (THR), leave allowance and condolence donation if they or their family members pass away. The employee welfare in the Company comprises of:

- Jamsostek (Life Insurance, Accident Insurance, Pension Fund);
- Medical Check Up;
- Family Gathering;
- Production Services;
- Leave;
- Health Care;
- Glasses Reimbursement; and
